</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Quality" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Output" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="OEE" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Output" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
</Parameters>
<LocalTags>
<LocalTag Name="TotalShiftTime" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Total shift time in minutes]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[480]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="480"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="TotalIdealTime" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="ST">
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[// --- Availability Calculation ---]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[IF (RunTime + Downtime) > 0 THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[    Availability := RunTime / (RunTime+Downtime);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="3">
<![CDATA[	Availability := Availability / (PlannedProductionTime/TotalShiftTime);]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="4">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[    Availability := 0.0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="7">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="8">
<![CDATA[// --- Performance Calculation ---]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="9">
<![CDATA[IF (RunTime + Downtime) > 0 AND TotalCount > 0 THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="10">
<![CDATA[    TotalIdealTime := IdealCycleTime * TotalCount;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="11">
<![CDATA[    Performance := TotalIdealTime / RunTime;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="12">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="13">
<![CDATA[    Performance := 0.0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="14">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="15">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="16">
<![CDATA[// --- Quality Calculation ---]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="17">
<![CDATA[IF TotalCount > 0 THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="18">
<![CDATA[    Quality := GoodCount / TotalCount;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="19">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="20">
<![CDATA[    Quality := 0.0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="21">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="22">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="23">
<![CDATA[// --- OEE Calculation ---]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="24">
<![CDATA[OEE := Availability * Performance * Quality;]]>
</Line>
</STContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="ProgramAlarmHandler" Class="Standard" Revision="3.0" RevisionExtension="a" Vendor="Steven Douglas Corp." ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2017-08-23T18:02:02.410Z" CreatedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\dshaner" EditedDate="2025-07-17T18:51:56.055Z"
 EditedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\jperry" SoftwareRevision="v37.00">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Creates a shared Alarm History array and a shared Active Alarms array.]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[v3.0 : 2022-06-16 D.E.S. Added Alarm Group to the AlarmData UDT.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[This AOI works in conjuction with the Alarms Porgram.

ControllerProgramIDTag needs to be the exact same tag for all instances of this AOI in your project.This AOI then uses that tag to uniquely identify each instance of the AOI in your project.

LocalAlarmsArrayTag is where you define each alarm for this AOI. Type in your Message and set the Severity when you create a new alarm. Severity is used on the HMI for coloring - found in the Alarm Display AOG background object's animation.

Use output coils or latches on the Active bit to trigger the alarm.

If you set DoNotSaveToHistory it will prevent the alarm from being put in the Alarm History array.

HMIActiveArrayTag and HMIHistoryArrayTag are arrays of the AlarmData UDT. They are shared by all instances of this AOI.

Alarm History is updated when an alarm becomes inactive so the Duration can be saved.

Changelog:
v3.0 : 2022-06-16 D.E.S. Added Alarm Group to the AlarmData UDT.
v2.3a: 2022-06-16 D.E.S. For Beckett. Severity MOD 200 because of different zones
v2.3 : 2022-06-14 D.E.S. Sort displayed alarm list by severity
v2.2 : 2022-01-03 D.E.S. Don't add alarm to active array if full.
v2.1 : 2021-05-11 D.E.S. Use UTC for date.
v2.0 : 2019-12-12 D.E.S. variable array lengths!
v1.2 : 2018-06-03 W.E.H. Changed NoFault to Faulted
v1.1 : 2017-09-12 W.E.H.
v1.0 : 2017-08-24 D.E.S.]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
