<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Map Ethernet IP Inputs Using CPS Instruction]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[CPS(fd01_InclineConveyor:I1.Data[0],fd01_InclineConveyor_IN,2) ,CPS(fd02_ReturnConveyor:I1.Data[0],fd02_ReturnConveyor_IN,2) ,AOI_Fanuc_IN(FlexFeederInputs,rob01_FlexFeeder:I1,rob01_FlexFeeder:I2,rob01_FlexFeederStatus,rob01_FlexFeederEDAIn) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
